title: Goodryke Faces a Vote of No Confidence!
subtitle: His first test of strength before the Assembly.
view-if: chancellor = "Goodryke" and papen_time and next_reichstag_time == rubicon_time and next_reichstag_time > 0 and papen_back
on-arrival: reichstag_rubicon = 1
new-page: true
tags: event
max-visits: 1
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/reichstag.jpg";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}

= Vote of No Confidence

Goodryke once again faces the Assembly, unfortunate to have taken power just a day before its scheduled reconvocation. It remains unclear whether he has secured a decree authorizing the Assembly’s dissolution, as he may still be banking on the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span>’s toleration. One thing, however, is certain: Goodryke has grown disillusioned with the prospect of a [+ royalist_chancellor +] chancellorship, and now that he holds power again, he has no intention of giving it up on their terms.

However, Goodryke, and President DuFour himself, believe that a forced adjournment of the Assembly may be necessary, with it only reconvening if a parliamentary majority could agree on a constructive course. This is only a bit less provocative than outright postponing elections, and a threat of civil war is omnipresent.

# TODO

- @reichstag

@reichstag
title: The Assembly goes into session.
on-arrival: {!
const contentElement = document.getElementById('content');
contentElement.style.backgroundColor = '#0A0A08';

const toolsWrapper = document.getElementById('tools_wrapper');
if (toolsWrapper) {
  toolsWrapper.style.display = 'none';
}

const header = document.querySelector('header');
header.style.color = '#ffffff';
!}

The Assembly is forcibly adjourned! Police officers and Commonwealth Army soldiers prevent parliamentarians from entering the building, and fierce riots emerge across the country as news of this unconstitutional act reaches all corners of the nation. The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span>, now convinced that this is all an elaborate plot by Goodryke to get back into power, firmly breaks with him and any chance of them entering government.

However, this time, the Commonwealth Army is much better equipped, internal conflict plagues the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>, and Mallin, now friendly with Goodryke once more pressures the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> to fight against leftists instead of the government. 

Now, it's on us. Shall we mobilize the the Banners?

- @reichstag_2
- @reichstag_3

@reichstag_2
title: We know Goodryke's intentions, we must not allow him to consolidate! We must take to the barricades to stop Goodryke from ending democracy.

Do we realize that this means civil war, against the full force of the state?

- @papen_civil_war: Yes.
- @reichstag_3: We are not ready for war. We must bide our time.

@reichstag_3
title: Bide our time.
on-arrival: commons_marcher -= 5; burgher_marcher -= 5; disfavored_marcher -= 5; pro_republic -= 15; banner_strength -= 500; banner_militancy *= 0.7; loyalist_strength += 50; vanguard_strength += 200; vanguard_militancy += 0.1; left_dissent += 60; center_dissent += 50; reformist_dissent += 40; labor_dissent += 40; knight_dissent += 40

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> is shocked at our decision! How can we allow such a blatant violation of the constitution go like that? Many radicalized the Banners and party officials defeat to the <span style="color: #700000;">**Communists**</span> and the <span style="color: #700000;">**Vanguard**</span>, vowing to fight against Goodryke regardless of our instructions.

- @reichstag_4
- @papen_civil_war_2

@papen_civil_war_2
title: The government cannot adequately suppress unrest, civil war is inevitable.
subtitle: We will fight, whether we choose to or not.
go-to: papen_civil_war

@reichstag_4
title: Martial law is declared. The Commonwealth Army quells pockets of unrest.
on-arrival: marburg_time = 0; marburg_trigger = 1; banner_strength -= 500; banner_militancy *= 0.7; loyalist_strength *= 0.5; vanguard_strength *= 0.5; commons_collectivist -= 5; disfavored_collectivist -= 5; commons_royalist -= 5; burgher_royalist -= 5; guild_royalist -= 5; landed_royalist -= 5; faithful_royalist -= 5; disfavored_royalist -= 5; disfavored += 2; economic_growth -= 1.5; pro_republic = 0
view-if: army_strength*army_militancy*(1-army_loyalty) >= (loyalist_strength*loyalist_militancy + vanguard_strength*vanguard_militancy + disfavored_royalist_normalized + disfavored_collectivist_normalized + commons_collectivist_normalized + disfavored_collectivist_normalized)

The disorganized <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">**Vanguard**</span> have failed to spark a mass uprising, and a civil war is averted. A widespread crackdown on paramilitaries have begun, with the the Banners not even being spared. 

- @root: Goodryke lives?